---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legal Terms - Quasar Contact"
  description="Privacy Policy and Legal Terms for Quasar Contact secure messaging platform. GDPR compliant data protection information."
>
  <div class="main-content page-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ip-header">
        <h2 class="ip-title">Legal Terms & Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="ip-sub">Your privacy and data protection rights</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

          <div class="space">
            <h3>Data I Collect</h3>
            <p>
              When you create an account on quasar.contact, I store your email address to enable
              user identification and account access. This is the only personal data I collect and
              store.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Purpose of Data Processing</h3>
            <p>Your email address is used exclusively to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Provide access to your account</li>
              <li>Distinguish between different users</li>
              <li>Enable secure authentication</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              I do not share your data with third parties, use it for marketing purposes, or analyze
              it for any commercial purposes.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Legal Basis</h3>
            <p>
              Data processing is carried out in accordance with Art. 6 Para. 1 lit. b GDPR (contract
              fulfillment) and Art. 6 Para. 1 lit. f GDPR (legitimate interests in providing secure
              communication services).
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Data Retention</h3>
            <p>
              Your data is stored as long as you maintain an account with me. When you delete your
              account, all personal data is permanently removed from my systems within 30 days.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Your Rights</h3>
            <p>Under GDPR, you have the following rights:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Right of Access:</strong> Request information about your stored data
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> Correct inaccurate personal data
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Right to Erasure:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Right to Restriction:</strong> Limit processing of your data
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Right to Data Portability:</strong> Receive your data in a structured format
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Right to Object:</strong> Object to processing of your personal data
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Right to Lodge a Complaint:</strong> File a complaint with a supervisory authority
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Hosting and Data Location</h3>
            <p>
              My website and services are hosted on cloud infrastructure providers. Servers may be
              located outside the EU. I ensure appropriate safeguards are in place for international
              data transfers in compliance with GDPR requirements.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space">
            <h3>Security Measures</h3>
            <p>
              I implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal
              data:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>End-to-end encryption for all messages</li>
              <li>Secure authentication mechanisms</li>
              <li>Regular security updates and monitoring</li>
              <li>Limited access to personal data on a need-to-know basis</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Terms of Service</h2>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Service Description</h3>
            <p>
              Quasar Contact provides end-to-end encrypted messaging services. The service is
              currently in beta stage and most features are stable with ongoing improvements.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>User Responsibilities</h3>
            <p>By using my service, you agree to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Use the service in compliance with applicable laws</li>
              <li>Not use the service for illegal activities</li>
              <li>Maintain the security of your account credentials</li>
              <li>Report security vulnerabilities responsibly</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Service Availability</h3>
            <p>
              While I strive for high availability, I do not guarantee uninterrupted service. The
              service is provided "as is" during the beta stage.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>
            <p>
              My liability is limited to the extent permitted by applicable law. I am not liable for
              any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Changes to Terms</h3>
            <p>
              I may update these terms from time to time. Users will be notified of significant
              changes via email or through the application.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Cookie Policy</h2>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>What Are Cookies</h3>
            <p>
              Cookies are small text files stored on your device to help improve your experience and
              enable certain functionality.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Cookies I Use</h3>
            <p>I use the following types of cookies:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for basic functionality and security
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Preference Cookies:</strong> Remember your settings and preferences
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> Help me understand how you use my service (anonymized)
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="space">
            <h3>Managing Cookies</h3>
            <p>
              You can control cookies through your browser settings. However, disabling certain
              cookies may affect the functionality of my service.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section legal-contact-section">
          <h2>Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            For any questions regarding these terms, privacy policy, or your data protection rights,
            please contact:
          </p>
          <div class="contact-info">
            <p>
              Email: <a href="mailto:contact@atpro.dev" class="security-email">
                contact@atpro.dev
              </a><br />
              Subject: Data Protection / Privacy Inquiry
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="legal-footer">
          <p>
            Last updated: June 21, 2025. This policy will be updated if there are any changes to my
            data processing practices.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Legal sections modernization */
  .legal-content {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-section {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .legal-section:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
  }

  .legal-contact-section {
    border-color: rgba(195, 247, 58, 0.18);
    background: rgba(195, 247, 58, 0.02);
  }

  .legal-contact-section:hover {
    border-color: rgba(195, 247, 58, 0.28);
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    color: var(--accent-green);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .legal-section h3 {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .legal-section .space {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .legal-section .space:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);
    line-height: 1.72;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.91rem;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.91rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .legal-section li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-section strong {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .contact-info {
    border: 1px solid rgba(195, 247, 58, 0.2);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    background: rgba(195, 247, 58, 0.04);
  }

  .contact-info p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .legal-footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .legal-footer p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-section {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
